  "title": "Brück's conjecture",
  "abstract": "Let f be a nonconstant entire function of finite hyper-order outside the positive integers. If f and its derivative share a finite complex value a counting multiplicities, then f' - a = c(f - a) on the complex plane for a nonzero complex constant c.",
